WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.503
Everyone turned to look at the door.

2
00:00:03.504 --> 00:00:06.133
"What's this?" said Mole.

3
00:00:06.134 --> 00:00:11.254
A big basket of food stumbled in.

4
00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:15.763
The basket tipped this way and that.

5
00:00:15.764 --> 00:00:19.821
Then Mole saw the choir leader under it.

6
00:00:19.822 --> 00:00:23.475
"He can't carry that much!" Mole yelled.

7
00:00:23.476 --> 00:00:27.536
Finally shy little Samuel said something.

8
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:31.096
"Look out!" he shouted.

9
00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:36.459
The basket spilled, and food rolled across the floor.

10
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.943
Surprised, Mole looked around.

11
00:00:39.944 --> 00:00:45.975
"Pudding! Jam! Turnips! Potatoes! Candy!

12
00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:50.052
Where did it all come from?" said Mole.

13
00:00:50.053 --> 00:00:53.343
"The play is over!" shouted Rat.

14
00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:55.252
"Pick up the food!"

15
00:00:55.253 --> 00:00:57.978
All the mice scattered.

16
00:00:57.979 --> 00:01:01.073
"I got an apple!" cried one mouse.

17
00:01:01.074 --> 00:01:04.156
"Here are some carrots!" cried another.

18
00:01:04.157 --> 00:01:08.054
Two mice fought over a piece of candy.

19
00:01:08.055 --> 00:01:11.355
Rat gave directions to every mouse:

20
00:01:11.356 --> 00:01:13.160
"Get the butter dish!

21
00:01:13.161 --> 00:01:15.462
Don't forget the napkins!

22
00:01:15.463 --> 00:01:19.587
Who has the forks?"

23
00:01:19.588 --> 00:01:21.997
Soon supper was ready.

24
00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:25.204
Mole took his seat at the head of the table.

25
00:01:25.205 --> 00:01:28.310
The mice sat on both sides.

26
00:01:28.311 --> 00:01:31.344
Rat sat at the other end.

27
00:01:31.345 --> 00:01:35.433
"I can't believe it," sighed Mole.

28
00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.880
"What a happy homecoming this is!"

29
00:01:38.881 --> 00:01:44.468
"Let's eat!" cried Rat, with his fork held high.

